match: Browser annotations
think 1.2
say Two annotations. Looking at the page.
tool Bash rade browser snapshot
out button "Add to cart" [ref=e7]
out heading "Gear for people who ship."
tool Read preview/styles.css
out Read 30 lines
think 0.8
say Tightening the hero, and making the
say buttons stand out.
tool Edit preview/styles.css
del .hero { padding: 72px 32px; }
add .hero { padding: 36px 32px; }
del .add { padding: 6px 12px; background: #3b4a54; }
add .add { width: 100%; padding: 12px;
add   font-weight: 600; background: #0f766e; }
sh sed -i 's|^\.hero { padding: 72px 32px;|.hero { padding: 36px 32px;|' preview/styles.css
sh sed -i 's|^\.add { .*|.add { width: 100%; padding: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; background: #0f766e; }|' preview/styles.css
tool Bash rade browser reload
sh rade browser reload && sleep 0.8 && rade browser eval 'window.scrollTo(0,0)'
pause 1.2
tool Bash rade browser screenshot
out Saved 1 image
say Done. The hero is 72px shorter and
say Add to cart is full width, in teal.
done
